{{Nihongo|'''''Honda Shigetomo'''''|本多重朝}} is the 23rd [[KTK]] [[Taisen drama]]. It aired on KTK from January 9, 1983 to December 18, 1983 spanning 49 episodes. The story centers on the life of the 16th century samurai and the second [[wikipedia:shogun|shogun]] of [[Okaiken]], [[Honda Shigetomo]]. Set between the end of the Sengoku Period and the beginning of the Imperial Shogunate, this follows the life and achievements of the second shogun Honda Shigetomo (Shinobu Otake). Production of this drama began on April 20, 1982.  The story is based on the novel ''Honda Shigetomo'' by Yuriko Nishida and was adapted for screen by scriptwriter Yoshitaro Shimizu. The series' music composer was Tomita Isao. It was the most watched drama in Sanese History until ''Honda Tenno'', also about the [[Honda clan]], premiered in 2014. 

